60">斗</span><span begin="0:31.660" end="0:31.839">争</span><span begin="0:31.839" end="0:32.401">过</span></p><p begin="0:32.749" end="0:36.329" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:32.749" end="0:33.149">失衡</span><span begin="0:33.149" end="0:33.267">的</span><span begin="0:33.267" end="0:34.049">棋盘</span> <span begin="0:34.049" end="0:35.188">我也只能参考你</span><span begin="0:35.188" end="0:35.597">修</span><span begin="0:35.597" end="0:35.759">正</span><span begin="0:35.759" end="0:36.329">我</span></p><p begin="0:36.710" end="0:37.968" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:36.710" end="0:37.199">参考你</span><span begin="0:37.199" end="0:37.547">修</span><span begin="0:37.547" end="0:37.699">正</span><span begin="0:37.699" end="0:37.968">我</span></p><p begin="0:38.139" end="0:39.959" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:38.139" end="0:39.665">比自己找出口有用的</span><span begin="0:39.665" end="0:39.959">多</span></p><p begin="0:40.147" end="0:42.003" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:40.147" end="0:41.077">但你关上灯</span><span begin="0:41.077" end="0:41.266">一</span><span begin="0:41.266" end="0:42.003">盏一盏</span></p><p begin="0:42.093" end="0:43.978" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:42.093" end="0:43.546">演绎的剧情是《一半一</span><span begin="0:43.546" end="0:43.978">半》</span></p><p begin="0:43.978" end="0:45.973" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:43.978" end="0:44.266">一半</span><span begin="0:44.266" end="0:44.516">是</span><span begin="0:44.516" end="0:44.788">憧</span><span begin="0:44.788" end="0:45.040">憬</span><span begin="0:45.040" end="0:45.466">一半是</span><span begin="0:45.466" end="0:45.858">回</span><span begin="0:45.858" end="0:45.973">忆</span></p><p begin="0:45.973" end="0:47.761" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:45.973" end="0:46.279">继续</span><span begin="0:46.279" end="0:46.940">下去也是</span><span begin="0:46.940" end="0:47.320">差</span><span begin="0:47.320" end="0:47.478">不</span><span begin="0:47.478" e